[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/hollow-star-dark.png" id="3_icon"]

; The pull spell (issue #64). A well opens in the thickest pack within BaseRange, drags everything
; within its reach into one knot, then collapses on what it gathered. Pure Darkness: the element had
; no pure spell, so it could never reach its capstone.
;
; Effect 7 (AreaSize) widens the pull reach in pixels; Effect 13 (ZoneDuration) lengthens the pull
; in seconds. Both are read in Player.FireHollowStar.

